+# Fixed canonical socket interface v1
+
+This distinct opt-in source mode supports exactly the qualified5a2b2e87 upper-lid GLB, immutable925fac95 parent and d454 eye-UV ancestor. It does not alter old anatomy/eye-UV modes or the preserved strict rejection. Unknown source bytes or modes fail closed.
+
+`socket_geometry.py` is byte-identical to the independently reviewed41c4394c predicate module. It uses exact rational triangle/segment events, closed oriented nonconvex source globes, parity/winding agreement and conservative whole-locus upper certificates. All142 replacement slots are owned as new head topology; none inherits original face-pair ancestry. Any patch/patch crossing fails. Only the20 original unchanged same-side BODY faces in the source-derived ledger may host an entirely embedded locus within14mm of the original same-face curve. Same-side globe contacts stay within7mm of original source patch/globe curves. These are fixed engineering limits, not photographic measurements. Seventeen new globe contact faces are disclosed rather than called inherited. The original20mm vertex,4MiB,20k-triangle, source/UV/skin/rig/hoof guards remain.
+
+The fixture crossing kernel, structural inspector, prior11 corruption-control result, strict24/82 rejection, old373 source-pair ledger and9176-byte physical loop are copied byte-exact and pinned. Archived `NATIVE-PRODUCER-readback-socket129.mjs` is producer source evidence, not a standalone new browser command. It retains the original physical loop a851… and actual double-precision capture path. The tiny neck influence is never rounded to zero.
+
+The versioned qualification summary records actual external static, native65keys+64midpoints and all129 posed socket PASS, actual closures, exact source/producer hashes and independent review. It does not claim app/photo/continuous/GPU collision or whole-gate acceptance. Portable native source paths differ from historical producer paths; the immutable raw GLB, recipe, geometry core, old protected inputs, limits and actual capture identity do not. `socket_sources.py` therefore checks explicit native inputs rather than incorrectly requiring the old entire db71 application selection to remain current.
+
+Routine gate:
+
+```sh
+python3 tools/test_standing_horse_upper_lid.py
+```
+
+It checks current explicit source selection, unchanged925/d454/foot/contact/credit contracts, exact deterministic regeneration, recorded129 certificate, genuine tiny corruption controls and a fresh current-source rest/static census. It does **not** run a browser or pretend to rerun129 on every preflight. `--source-only` is explicitly a partial development check and skips actual static/tiny-census suites.
+
+Explicit source phases, with fresh external output paths and the normal owned supervisor/heavy slot:
+
+```sh
+python3 tools/transport/horse_socket_interface_v1/socket_qualification.py --mode canonical_socket_interface_v1 --phase static --out /tmp/fresh-socket-static.json
+python3 tools/transport/horse_socket_interface_v1/socket_qualification.py --mode canonical_socket_interface_v1 --phase posed --poses /path/to/exact-f5384e8c-capture/POSE-MANIFEST.json --out /tmp/fresh-socket-posed.json
+```
+
+The posed command verifies the exact qualified native capture, its original producer/code/input/closure bindings, full Float64 arrays, actual paired node/skeleton/bind states and independent physical-loop matrices before reevaluating every pose. It never relabels this replay as a new browser capture. New geometry/skin/rig/clip/recipe/kernel semantics invalidate the fixed mode and require fresh qualification and an explicitly reviewed binding.
+
+Raw capture/full19.70MB proof and the original31-file external packet remain preserved outside this app. The compact committed summary cites their exact hashes; routine CI does not depend on those local artifact paths. Creation-time unqualified flags inside exact5a GLB remain historical bytes, while the later recorded qualification is separate and source-bound.
